          <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mb-2">2 seats included + $15/additional member</p>
          <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm mb-6">For teams mixing AI and human workers.</p>
          <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm text-gray-300 mb-8 flex-1">
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><Check className="w-4 h-4 text-brand-teal shrink-0" /> 2 team members included</li>
